@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### ==================== AUTH ====================

### Registrar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lucas Silva",
  "email": "lucas@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lucas@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Meu perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==================== USERS ====================

### Listar usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/ID_DO_USUARIO

### Criar usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "email": "maria@email.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Atualizar usuário
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/ID_DO_USUARIO
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza Atualizada"
}

### ==================== TICKETS ====================

### Listar tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar ticket por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/ID_DO_TICKET
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar ticket - suporte técnico
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Não consigo fazer login no sistema, aparece erro de acesso"
}

### Criar ticket - ouvidoria
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Quero registrar uma denúncia de assédio"
}

### Criar ticket - financeiro
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Recebi uma cobrança indevida no meu cartão"
}

### Criar ticket - sac
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Meu produto chegou com defeito na entrega"
}

### Atualizar status do ticket
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/ID_DO_TICKET/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "em_atendimento"
}
